{"about":"The eight pickups. orb is an orb's sizes in field units: its radius, its rim's width, how far its halo reaches and the side of its symbol's square, of which sides gives each group's own. A pickup's group is told by its orb's rim: one ring for a weapon, a doubled ring for a guard, a ring cut in four arcs for a field effect. A symbol is in shares of its square about its middle, y down: fills are polygons, lines are strokes of a width with round ends and joins, and cuts are lines drawn over those in the color of the glass under them. The rim and the halo take the palette's accent, the glass the field with a little of the accent, and the symbol the accent mixed toward white in a dark palette and toward the field's text in a light one. small is the symbol as it is under 10 pixels a unit, where it differs.","orb":{"radius":1.1,"rim":0.17,"halo":2.05,"symbol":1.32},"sides":{"weapon":1.32,"guard":1.1352,"field":1.2672},"pickups":[{"name":"orb-spread","symbol":"symbol-spread","id":"spread","title":"Spread","group":"weapon","lines":[{"points":[[-0.1,0.36],[-0.4,-0.2]],"width":0.1},{"points":[[0,0.38],[0,-0.36]],"width":0.1},{"points":[[0.1,0.36],[0.4,-0.2]],"width":0.1},{"points":[[-0.33,-0.08],[-0.42,-0.25]],"width":0.24},{"points":[[0,-0.22],[0,-0.41]],"width":0.24},{"points":[[0.33,-0.08],[0.42,-0.25]],"width":0.24}],"fills":[],"cuts":[]},{"name":"orb-rapid","symbol":"symbol-rapid","id":"rapid","title":"Rapid","group":"weapon","lines":[{"points":[[-0.36,-0.02],[0,-0.38],[0.36,-0.02]],"width":0.17},{"points":[[-0.36,0.4],[0,0.04],[0.36,0.4]],"width":0.17}],"fills":[],"cuts":[]},{"name":"orb-shield","symbol":"symbol-shield","id":"shield","title":"Shield","group":"guard","lines":[],"fills":[[[-0.4,-0.42],[0.4,-0.42],[0.4,0],[0.35,0.19],[0.21,0.35],[0,0.47],[-0.21,0.35],[-0.35,0.19],[-0.4,0]]],"cuts":[]},{"name":"orb-ship","symbol":"symbol-ship","id":"ship","title":"Extra ship","group":"guard","lines":[{"points":[[0.3,-0.44],[0.3,-0.1]],"width":0.13},{"points":[[0.13